ore years they broke up.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"Where Are They Now? Part 4","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rrkmfJQBpHQ"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Opening for Stone Temple Pilots","body":"Early in their career in the 1990s, Head played a club show in Toronto as an opening act for the then-unknown American band, Stone Temple Pilots. \"And remember seeing them play a club show in Toronto in the opening act with some unknown American band called Stone Temple Pilots.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"Where Are They Now? Part 4","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rrkmfJQBpHQ"}]}],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":195717189761455,"type":"album","name":"Head","list_id":100525930599399,"list":"RYM Top — Electronic — Space Ambient","src":"musthear","rank":107,"year":1970,"note":null,"yt":"yqDYnEfbI-k","scaruffi":null},{"id":246723167303235,"type":"album","name":"Tales of Ordinary Madness","list_id":53161726480591,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Baggy","src":"musthear","rank":86,"year":1988,"note":null,"yt":"1wTErd5zWjw","scaruffi":null},{"id":234468963364856,"type":"album","name":"Save Me From Myself","list_id":123222823710685,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Christian Rock","src":"musthear","rank":90,"year":2008,"note":null,"yt":"AyCok7Wip2I","scaruffi":null},{"id":234468963364856,"type":"album","name":"Save Me From Myself","list_id":231494109508031,"list":"RYM Top — Scenes & Movements — CCM","src":"musthear","rank":86,"year":2008,"note":null,"yt":"AyCok7Wip2I","scaruffi":null}],"lists":[]}